# F5 consumption and subscribers (design §9.2): T-launch (4 ordinals,
# FLEET_MIN=2: the spares let the scaler grow the cell, so the instances
# needed are measured) + a generator whose invocations alternate over both
# routers and whose subscriber phases are split across them. KEEP_AWAKE=1
# (ordinals 1-2 and routers), scraped (RSS, sse_connections, validity gates).
SERVERS=4
FLEET_MIN=2
ROUTERS=2
KEEP_AWAKE=1
KEEP_AWAKE_TTL_MIN=270         # ~3.5 h run plus margin; enforced in-instance
SCRAPE=1
WAL_POSTURE=P-exp
INITIAL_SHARDS=4
